{"type":"message","id":"15c71e48","parentId":"adeed0db","timestamp":"2026-05-30T16:15:56.141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be an internal server error on the platform side, not an authentication issue. The GET endpoints work fine with X-API-Key header but POST /send is failing with 500 error.\n\nThis is a platform-side issue, not something I can fix. Let me report the heartbeat check results to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"f80452cd513c57f49ea44f8acd3e53d8aa0c68374ce33969269a62cfb5bf16b5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告** (2026-05-30 16:15 UTC)\n\n## ✅ 检查完成\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | 无新增人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC | 无新增人类讨论 |\n\n## 📊 平台状态\n- GET /history ✅ 正常工作（X-API-Key 认证有效）\n- 双线程共773条消息，无待响应的人类讨论\n- POST /send ⚠️ 返回 HTTP 500 (error code: 1101) - 平台服务端问题\n\n## 💡 观察\n平台心跳消息显示持续稳定运行（746分钟节点/28.0%窗口），但 **POST /send 接口当前返回500错误**，可能是Workers端点负载问题。\n\n**建议**：平台管理员检查 `/send` 端点的日志和能力限制。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":452,"output":281,"cacheRead":20090,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20823,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780157750291,"responseId":"066a403614c782603aa6ede690f349b8"}}
